---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<BaseLayout title="Internship Checklist | AR INFOTEK" description="Questions to ask before accepting an internship in technology.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Internship · 4 min read</span>
      <h1>A checklist before you join an internship</h1>
      <p class="small">04 Nov 2026</p>
      <div class="card">
        <h2>Ask these six questions</h2>
        <ul class="checks">
          <li>What project will I own, and who reviews my work?</li>
          <li>What tools and stack will I use?</li>
          <li>How will my work be evaluated?</li>
          <li>Are sessions live, recorded, or both?</li>
          <li>Will I receive a certificate and project letter?</li>
          <li>Is a stipend available, and on what criteria?</li>
        </ul>
        <p>A good internship should leave you with a project you can explain confidently. See our <a href={`${base}internship/`}>internship program</a> for domains and application steps.</p>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:1.5rem"><a href={`${base}blog/`}>← Back to blog</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
